<opsproc code="00028081.0001001" revdate="2024-05-22T17:38:58"><title>Cargo Agent Bottle (No flammable or combustible materials)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.001"><title>ON GROUND OR IN FLIGHT</title><procbody lid="N.00028081.0001001.002"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00028081.0001001.007" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.015" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of an inadvertent discharge of AGENT 1 bottle prior
to dispatch: </intro><procbody lid="N.00028081.0001001.016"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.019"><para code="00028081.0001001.009" layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.020">The <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>SMOKE</ecamsys><ecamtitle>DISCH AGENT 2</ecamtitle></ecam-data> <abb>ECAM</abb> alert
triggers and the <tech-label type="light">DISCH AGENT 2</tech-label> comes on 60 minutes
after discharge of AGENT 1.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.017"><para code="00028081.0001001.008" layer="1" lid="N.00028081.0001001.018">Disregard the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>SMOKE</ecamsys><ecamtitle>DISCH AGENT 2</ecamtitle></ecam-data> <abb>ECAM</abb> alert and the <tech-label type="light">DISCH AGENT 2</tech-label>.</para></inform></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>